  "description": "Convert an integer to its base 7 string representation.",
  "target": "100",
  "pseudocode": "1. if num == 0 return \"0\"\n2. isNegative = num < 0\n3. num = abs(num)\n4. res = []\n5. while num > 0:\n6.   res.append(num % 7)\n7.   num = num // 7\n8. if isNegative: res.append('-')\n9. return reverse(res).join()",
